# cargo-fuzz working state (corpus grows unbounded; artifacts are
# crash inputs the operator triages locally). Checked-in seeds live
# under `crates/<c>/fuzz/seeds/<target>/`.
**/fuzz/corpus/
**/fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/target/

# Operator's personal-site design explorations (HTML mockups, drafts,
# work-in-progress). Lives outside the swarm — stays local until the
# operator picks a direction.
docs/personal-site/

# Repo-root active workspace config. The gateway reads `argo.toml` from
# its cwd; the operator copies `docs/skycot/operator/argo.dev.toml.example`
# here to activate Claude Code subscription routing for local dev/demo.
# It carries local-only routing/provider knobs and must NEVER be
# committed (committing it would change CI/test routing). Only the
# `.example` template is tracked.
/argo.toml

# Generated, on-demand build artifact rendered from docs/build-plan/FEATURE_MATRIX.md
# (the .md is the source-of-truth ledger). The committed HTML caused a hard merge
# conflict on every pair of concurrent FEATURE_MATRIX PRs, stalling otherwise-clean
# PRs — root-fixed by gitignoring it (DEC-043). Regenerate locally to view:
#   python3 scripts/render-feature-matrix.py
docs/skycot/feature-matrix.html
